n        *   Row 1: Ava Chen, Editor, Active\n        *   Row 2: Noah Park, Viewer, Suspended\n    *   *3) Inputs:* No form fields visible.\n    *   *4) State signals:* None visible (no spinners, toasts, modals, etc.).\n    *   *5) Blockers:* None visible.\n    *   *6) Unknowns:* None.\n\n4.  **Refining and Formatting:**\n    *   Check constraints: \"no prose intro, no conclusion, no 'this screenshot shows...', no layout description unless it matters\".\n    *   Let's refine the \"Visible text\" to be a clean list of exact strings.\n\n    *Drafting exact output:*\n    1) Page purpose: Workspace team members management page.\n    2) Visible text: \"WebScène\", \"Home\", \"Workspace\", \"Activity\", \"Team members\", \"Filter\", \"NAME\", \"ROLE\", \"ACCESS\", \"Ava Chen\", \"Editor\", \"Active\", \"Noah Park\", \"Viewer\", \"Suspended\"\n    3) Inputs: None.\n    4) State signals: None.\n    5) Blockers: None.\n    6) Unknowns: None.\n\n    Wait, the logo is \"WebScène\" or \"WebScene\"? It looks like \"WebScène\" with a green accent on the e.","role":"assistant"},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

